WEBVTT

00:08:24.546 --> 00:08:30.576
kama, mfano, Emily Dickinson,
Jane Austen, Isaac Newton, and Bill Gates

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.337
ni baadhi ya mifano.

00:08:32.361 --> 00:08:34.114
Lakini tatizo linalokuwepo

00:08:34.138 --> 00:08:37.975
ni kuwa haya maoni mazuri
mara nyingi hayawezi shirikishwa

00:08:37.999 --> 00:08:40.263
kama kuna ukinzani wa mawasiliano.

00:08:41.249 --> 00:08:45.975
Na hivyo watu wengi wenye usonji
wanapitwa bila kuonekana kila siku,

00:08:45.999 --> 00:08:47.809
na pia wanachukuliwa faida yao.

00:08:49.175 --> 00:08:56.070
Hivyo ndoto yangu kwa watu wenye usonji
ni kubadilisha hiyo,

00:08:56.094 --> 00:08:59.021
na kuondoa ukinzani
unaowazuia wao kufanikiwa.

00:08:59.808 --> 00:09:02.310
Sababu moja wapo ninayopendelea 
kuota ndoto